window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>CHARLIE DOESN'T PLAY BY THE RULES... </p> <p>She likes sleeping with men. </p> <p>Sometimes it's not a choice. </p> <p>Life hasn't been easy for Charlie. Her mother was a monster. And when Charlie left home, there wasn't always a warm bed, food, or a hot shower. </p> <p>She figured out how to get by on her looks. </p> <p>When her mother dies and she comes home to put that part of her life behind her, she finds the diary. </p> <p>It fills her with rage. </p> <p>She's out for revenge. </p> <p>But along the way she meets him. </p> <p>Ethan DOES play by the rules. And at the top of his list is \"Don't get involved with clients.\" Will he break his rules for Charlie?</p>"; 
